  "bio": "Aaron Riddle is a skilled tattoo artist based in Phoenix, Arizona, with a private studio. He specializes in neotraditional and black & gray styles, infusing his work with a unique desert psychedelic aesthetic. His professionalism is seen in the way he manages his bookings and his dedication to maintaining the cleanliness of his studio.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location:\n\nDesert Psychedelic  \n1619 E McDowell Rd Unit E\nPhoenix AZ\n@blackclaw \n@desert_psychedelic \n*BOOKS OPEN*  \nAppts: aaronriddle138@gmail.com",
